  "references": [
    {
      "url": "https://www.inyourpocket.com/warsaw/warsaw-then-now_74815f",
      "imageUrl": "https://s.inyourpocket.com/gallery/177440.jpg",
      "observed": "Actually inspected ordinary oblique entrance photograph. Broad metal roof with a deep cantilever, gently bowed underside and raised edges; slim tall rounded external pillars with capital/beam attachments. Recessed glass upper entrance and long facade bands sit below a dark grey metal fascia. Roof underside has parallel panel seams/ribs. Roof gold tone is warm sunlight, not evidence of gold material. No copied lettering/signs/brands."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://culture.pl/en/article/9-architectural-icons-of-communist-poland",
      "imageUrl": "https://api.culture.pl/sites/default/files/images/imported/architektura/galerie/gl%20mies%20van%20der%20rohe%20award%202013/mies%20van%20der%20rohe%20award%201_6687250.jpg",
      "observed": "Actually inspected ordinary aerial nighttime overview. Complete broad blue-lit rectangular roof with subtle long seams and shaped/folded short edges; recessed upper glazing and low opaque band; both end/side entry fronts; tall external supports; broad shallow entrance stair flights. Low long canopy/covered walk runs beside the bus bays. Neighboring tower/mall/bus/taxi context is independent. Blue roof is nighttime lighting, not a daytime blue paint observation."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://build.protomaps.com/20261031.pmtiles",
      "observed": "Approximate physical association, not an exact tagged PMTiles parent. Scope includes the whole permanent aboveground main hall, both shell roof outlines, all mapped tall columns, nested lower/mezzanine/clerestory masses and two north-side low platform/covered-walk roofs. Preserve the independent Zlote Tarasy mall and its bridge/service structures, hotels, office towers, streets, native rail/tunnels and small surrounding kiosks. Layer-1 parent is an ownership envelope, not permission to fill an aboveground cuboid or mask the whole roof footprint."
    }
